==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 52.67 seconds<sup>1,580f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 55.33 seconds<sup>1,660f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

